<title>USA: FelCor share offering raises $354 million.</title>
<headline>FelCor share offering raises $354 million.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>FelCor Suite Hotels Inc said Monday it raised $354 million in a secondary offering of 10.2 shares of common stock to the public for $36.625 each.</p>
<p>The company will use the proceeds to buy 11 hotels, including five Sheraton hotels, four Doubletree Guest Suites hotels, two Embassy Suites hotels, and to repurchase 1.2 outstanding shares of common stock from Promus Hotels.</p>
<p>The offering was made, within the U.S. and Canada, through Morgan Stanley Dean Witter, Smith Barney Inc, Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc, Montgomery Securities, PaineWebber International, and Salomon Brothers International Ltd.</p>
